{
  "v": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Deliverable-first time notes and the first-token stall watchdog, docs/CONTRACTS.md section 35.",
    "Both opt-in. Absent (or false / 0), every request body is master's: deliverable_first.test.ts",
    "holds the hashes sweep_knobs.test.ts pinned on ae17a1ae.",
    "p2g_tasks: the 29 Terminal-Bench task instructions of P2G41 (2026-11-05), by name, the first 16 hex",
    "of the sha256 of each instruction.md, and the output files a reader labels as the deliverables the",
    "instruction tells the agent to write (labelled by hand before the extractor was run on them).",
    "The instructions themselves are not in this repository (benchmark canary); the test reads them from",
    "GNOMON_P2G_DATASET, or the default local path, and skips the comparison where they are absent.",
    "not_extracted: what the labelling found and the extractor leaves out on purpose."
  ],
  "key": "config.toml [turn] deliverable_first",
  "values": [
    true,
    false
  ],
  "default": false,
  "read_only_under": "gnomon task --deadline",
  "at": [
    0.4,
    0.7
  ],
  "max_named": 12,
  "verbs": [
    "write",
    "save",
    "create",
    "produce",
    "output",
    "emit",
    "generate",
    "build",
    "implement",
    "add",
    "put",
    "place",
    "store",
    "export"
  ],
  "note": "These required outputs do not exist yet: {paths}. Write a first complete version now, then improve it.",
  "counter": "deliverable_first_notes",
  "audit": {
    "kind": "deliverable_first",
    "events": [
      "named",
      "check"
    ],
    "named_fields": [
      "event",
      "named",
      "at"
    ],
    "check_fields": [
      "event",
      "at",
      "step",
      "used",
      "named",
      "missing",
      "noted"
    ]
  },
  "first_token": {
    "key": "config.toml [resilience] first_token_timeout_ms",
    "default": 0,
    "streamed_only": true,
    "timed_out": "first_token",
    "code": 11,
    "counter": "first_token_stalls",
    "wire_field": "first_token_timeout_ms",
    "audit": {
      "kind": "first_token_stall",
      "fields": [
        "role",
        "step",
        "attempt",
        "waited_ms",
        "recovered"
      ]
    }
  },
